 11   4010              ; A loop of 59,735 T-states, with the interrupts off, that draws a white
 12   4010              ; stripe on the black border once a turn. On a 60 Hz machine a frame is
 13   4010              ; 59,736 T-states; if the loop is longer or shorter the stripe moves.
